{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gang Wars is a lighthearted arcade shooter game</strong> for kids and families. The rule is simple: move fast, shoot faster, and stay in the game as long as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face waves of funny cartoon gangsters \u2014 each round they get quicker, stronger, and trickier. Can you defeat them all, collect the coins, and upgrade your gear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 fun and challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 characters (1 hero + 12 silly rivals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 weapon types, plus grenades and bombs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins to upgrade your gun and barricade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, funny animations and easy controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 <strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong><br>Gang Wars is fast, colorful, and addictive \u2014 perfect for short play sessions or longer challenges. Kids can enjoy the funny animations and upgrades, while parents can relax knowing it\u2019s all cartoon fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So grab your gear, collect the coins, and see if you can survive all 40 levels of action!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Machinegun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1511610/65a9ad2956c426b239af148adb6859c46ad83b96.jpg"},{"name":"Dual Handgun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1511610/73a6fa39923020ee6fb7df14ad1ddf5be45b359c.jpg"},{"name":"Handgun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1511610/d2924d91ba27ac9b1c4ee1bef80dce31d5ebba08.jpg"},{"name":"Shotgun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1511610/ecb767164d74fdf314e7d8533903956bde6c085c.jpg"},{"name":"Submachine","